WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Okay, you've seen the worlds.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.900
Let me show you a few things
we skipped last time.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.800
From the dashboard,
your tools are right here.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.230
Let's open PRLX in the Terminal.

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:13.000
You can switch the chart's
time frame, zoom in,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.600
and open the token evidence
when you want a closer look.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.350
Now, Wallet Watch.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.150
Start with a public Solana address
or a handle,

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.360
and keep the wallets you follow
together in a watchlist.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.150
It's a handy place to organize
what you're researching.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.840
Looking for something new?

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.200
Trenches puts fresh launches,
tokens near graduation,

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.930
and graduated tokens side by side.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.180
Open the filters to narrow the list.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.850
And this is Replay.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.700
Hit play, scrub through the timeline,
then scroll down

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.120
to inspect the transactions
and the wallets involved.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.030
You can look at buys and sells
separately, too.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.100
That's the other side of Parallax:
tools to explore

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.850
what's happening on the chain,
alongside the worlds and the game.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.810
Come click around at parallaxlaunch.live.
